  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/yang-jiayi/furusato-fabric-workshop/ontology/furusato#GiftCategory__CategoryId">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" />
    <rdfs:comment>Stable numeric identifier for one GiftCategory entity. Use it with the stored category labels and never sum or average it.</rdfs:comment>
