  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://github.com/yang-jiayi/furusato-fabric-workshop/ontology/furusato#GiftInCategory">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" />
    <rdfs:comment>Classifies a Gift in exactly one GiftCategory. Category-level donation metrics must traverse DonationSelectedGift first and aggregate DonationAmountYen from Donation.</rdfs:comment>
