    <rdfs:comment>Pre-aggregated current-static-snapshot metric for one recipient Prefecture and one GiftCategory pair with at least one Donation. It excludes time-series observations and Suppliers; values must not be summed again outside this grain.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label>PrefectureCategoryMetric</rdfs:label>
